-- De-AI pass over the practice-question bank, part 10 of 11 (81 questions).
-- Removes em (—) and en (–) dashes; prose rewritten so it reads as human-written.
-- LaTeX, markdown tables, answer-choice count/order/labels and chemical hyphens are preserved.
